### 🔴 CRITICAL #2 — `users` Table Has No RLS (Fully Public Read)

The `users` table has **Row Level Security disabled**. Combined with the public anon key in `admin.html`, anyone on the internet can run:

```
GET https://nukbdmyqizrnkmbusdtm.supabase.co/rest/v1/users?select=*
Headers: apikey: <anon key from your JS>
```

And receive **every user's name, email, phone, role, and password.**

**Fix:**
```sql
ALTER TABLE public.users ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Block anon reads on users" ON public.users;
-- No SELECT policy = no one can read it anonymously
```

