## REMEDIATION PLAN

### Step 1 — Do RIGHT NOW (5 minutes in Supabase SQL Editor)

```sql
-- 1. Lock the users table completely from anon access
ALTER TABLE public.users ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;

-- 2. Lock personnel table writes (reads already fixed)
ALTER TABLE public.personnel ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
DROP POLICY IF EXISTS "Allow public read on personnel" ON public.personnel;
CREATE POLICY "Allow public read on personnel"
  ON public.personnel FOR SELECT USING (true);

-- 3. Lock meetings from anon writes
ALTER TABLE public.meetings ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
CREATE POLICY "Allow read on meetings"
  ON public.meetings FOR SELECT USING (true);

-- 4. Lock reservation writes from anon
ALTER TABLE public.reservations ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
CREATE POLICY "Allow read on reservations"
  ON public.reservations FOR SELECT USING (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow insert on reservations"
  ON public.reservations FOR INSERT WITH CHECK (true);
CREATE POLICY "Allow update on reservations"
  ON public.reservations FOR UPDATE USING (true);
```

